#: forms/list_forms.py:370
msgid ""
"The number of notices a disabled member will receive before their address is"
" removed from the mailing list's roster. Set this to 0 to immediately remove"
" an address from the list once their bounce score exceeds the threshold. "
"This value must be an integer. "
msgstr ""
"Antalet meddelanden som en inaktiverad medlem får innan adressen tas bort "
"från sändlistan. Ange 0 för att ta bort adressen direkt när returpoängen "
"överstiger tröskelvärdet. Värdet måste vara ett heltal. "

#: forms/list_forms.py:331
msgid ""
"This option controls whether or not the list owner is notified when a "
"member's subscription is automatically disabled due to their bounce "
"threshold being reached. "
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet styr om listägaren meddelas när en medlems "
"prenumeration inaktiveras automatiskt eftersom tröskelvärdet för returpoäng "
"har nåtts. "
